            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "criterion is supplanted by a criterion that involves the third order comoment. With  $ \\mathbf{X}_{0} = \\mathbf{X} $ and  $ \\mathbf{Y}_{0} = \\mathbf{Y} $ as before, the ith  $ \\mathbf{X} $-side weight solves",
